            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This study can be considered as the start of the Eurobarometer series. It focuses on satisfaction with various aspects of life and society and European unification. Themes: satisfaction with conditions of living, society, democracy / expectations for the future / respect / job values / environment / political attitudes and values / desirable goals for society / cosmopolitan attitudes / information on the EC / awareness of the EC / support for the EC / political problems / goals for EC / support for political unification / political involvement / opinion leadership / left-right self-placement / left-right partisanship index / post - materialist index ( Inglehart ). Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ household characteristics/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ politics/ religion/ organizational membership</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
